::ingredients

(salmon) 2 pieces
(liquid) = (water) 4 cups -OR- (stock) 4 cups
(leek) 1
(butter) 1/4 cup
(potato) 5-7
(carrot) 1-2
(heavy cream) 1 cup
(salt) to taste
(pepper) to taste
(dill) for garnish

::equipment

(pot)

::instructions

(leek) + (potato) + (carrot) <wash> <clean> <dice>
(salmon) <descale, or remove skin> <dice>
(butter) + (leek) <cook, pot, medium-high, 5m, until wilted>
    + (liquid) + (potato) + (carrot) <bring to boil>
    <cook, medium, 10-15m, potatoes ready>
    + (salmon) + (heavy cream) <cook, 5-10m>
    + (salt) + (pepper) <season>
    + (dill) <garnish>

::story

This soup is also known as Lohikeitto.

